    "en": {
      "trackName": "Idle King tycoon 4 watch",
      "description": "Idle King is an idle tycoon game about building an American business empire from the ground up.\n\nA British entrepreneur arrives in the United States with big ambitions and a small workshop. Start by hiring workers, running production, and earning your first profits. Then expand into factories, unlock new industries, and reinvest to grow faster.\n\nYour goal is to take your business coast to coast. Open locations in new states, upgrade operations, and build a nationwide network until your empire spans all 50 states.\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Idle tycoon gameplay with satisfying growth\n- Hire workers and automate production\n- Build and upgrade factories across industries\n- Expand state by state across America\n- Simple controls designed for quick sessions\n- Progress even while you are away\n\nTurn a humble workshop into a coast-to-coast business empire.",
